  stickyNoteInfos:
  - title: X along base
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 1718
      y: 1196
      width: 232
      height: 107
    contents: 'X is the position of the particle on the segment

      X = 0 at the
      center

      X is negative when closer to Pos2 and positive when closer to
      Pos1'
    theme: Classic
    textSize: Small
  - title: We tilt
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 829
      y: 2145
      width: 218
      height: 102
    contents: 'Because otherwise we can''t see quad textures that are aligned with
      camera (camera in texture plane)

      Those quads have a low OrthogonalFactor
      (close to 0)'
    theme: Classic
    textSize: Small
  - title: About the dot product
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 2252
      y: 1307
      width: 341
      height: 164
    contents: 'It is neater to compute dot product of vector 1 : going from center
      of segment to particle position and vector 2 : going from particle position
      to camera (viewer position)


      but for this choice of vector 1 it created
      glitches at the center of segments. So we just choose another vector in the
      same direction, just with an offset (still aligned with segment)'
    theme: Classic
    textSize: Small
  categories: []
  uiBounds:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: -1439
    y: -549
    width: 5039
    height: 4129
